lowgeo help=Structura draws every block in full detail. Vibrant Visuals lights each of those shapes, so a large structure can be demanding to render. Low geometry redraws only the most detailed blocks as simpler shapes, keeping their textures and their positions, which is far cheaper on the graphics card.
